%$n$ is even. Let $xy\in E(G)$
%be an edge.  We show that $G[N(x)-\{y\}]$
%contains an edge $x_1x_2$ and $G[N(y)-\{x\}]$
%contains an edge $y_1y_2$ such that the two edges are independent.
