The module is now implemented around the paper’s exact \(H_1\)/\(Q\) construction. A planted certificate already expands into a directly checked Halin tree and planar leaf cycle at every preset. I’m running the expensive gates now; the likely pressure points are structure-aware sampling, the 256-restart attack, and canonical diversity across true graph isomorphisms.
