codex
I found and fixed a measurement bottleneck: the first run was repeatedly rebuilding the 193-edge shipping graph for every random guess. The optimized measurement still performs exact membership checks and full verification on any surviving prefix, but caches the instance graph and template objects; the demo enumeration remains genuinely exhaustive.
