%such that the Blow-up lemma in the equal size case\,(all $|V_i|$ are the same) remains true if for every $i$
%there are certain vertices $x$ to be embedded into $V_i$ whose images are a priori restricted to certain sets
%$C_x\subseteq V_i$ provided that
%\vspace{-2mm}
