is corresponding to a subset $V_1$ of $V(G)$ such that $|V_1|\ge (1/2-6\beta)lN\ge (1/2-7\beta)n$
and $\Delta(G[V_1])\le (d+\ve)n'\le \beta n$. This implies that $G$ is in Extremal Case 2,
